        "title": "Recognise the Pattern",
        "text": "The difference of two squares pattern is:\n\n$$a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b)$$\n\nLook at $9x^2 - 16$. Is this a difference (subtraction) of two perfect squares?",
